# Auth Endpoints

### Register User
POST {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "currencyCode": "COP",
  "emergencyFundMonths": 3
}

###

### Login User
POST {{JuliGastos.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

